  "description": "NetToolsKit.Observability delivers practical logging and tracing foundations for .NET services.\n\n\t\t\tFeatures:\n\t\t\t• Serilog setup with useful enrichers for context‑rich logs.\n\t\t\t• OpenTelemetry integration for traces and metrics.\n\t\t\t• Friendly DI integration to wire everything up quickly.\n\n\t\t\tIdeal for services that need production‑ready diagnostics with minimal setup.",
